# Canonical origin for metadataBase, canonical URLs, the sitemap, robots.txt and
# the structured data.
#
# OPTIONAL ON VERCEL. If this is unset, the site falls back to
# VERCEL_PROJECT_PRODUCTION_URL and then VERCEL_URL, both of which Vercel sets for
# you — so a deployment produces correct absolute URLs with no configuration.
#
# Set it once you have a custom domain, so canonicals point there rather than at
# the *.vercel.app host.
#
# Leave it UNSET rather than blank: an empty value is treated as absent here, but
# blank env vars are a common way to confuse a build.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://your-domain.com
